    <title>031杵拐时光-康复、残障与照护｜野生芝士</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a1f0e82989e711d015f6cfd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a1f0e82989e711d015f6cfd</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2026 17:00:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播摔断了膝盖韧带，本期节目主要分享运动受伤后对康复、残障和照护的一些经验和反思。</span></p><p></p><p><span>你将听到的声音：</span></p><p><span>🍄Emily</span></p><p><span>🍍菠萝油</span></p><p></p><p><span>⌛️时间轴：</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>——<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a></span></p><p><span>小心翼翼攀岩还是摔断了膝盖</span></p><p><span>伤经动骨居然不静养</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a>——<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a></span></p><p><span>受伤后bro点评不约而至</span></p><p><span>怎么看待运动受伤</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a>——<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a></span></p><p><span>残障不是少数人的处境</span></p><p><span>人只是暂时的健全</span></p><p><span>想建一个无障碍厕所有多难</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a>——<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a></span></p><p><span>前叉手术可能是身强力健者的第一个大手术</span></p><p><span>被照护的羞耻感</span></p><p><span>反思自己的恐弱情绪</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">3:50</a>——<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2420">40:20</a></span></p><p><span>《看护杀人》——为什么杀死自己爱的人</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2420">40:20</a>——<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3510">58:30</a></span></p><p><span>《三更半夜居然要吃香蕉》</span></p><p><span>不一样的照护实践</span></p><p><span>耗竭型的照护和有边界的善意</span></p><p><span>对照护的焦虑是学习和思考的新开始</span></p><p></p><p><span>📚本期书目：</span></p><p><span>《看护杀人》</span></p><p><span>《三更半夜居然要吃香蕉》</span></p><p></p><p><span>🎵：《三更半夜居然要吃香蕉》电影主题曲</span></p>]]></description>
