  <item>
    <title>026双城之战：拉片棒，逻辑乱+聊聊内战|野生芝士</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6757b1d4d5e50f16d98472bd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6757b1d4d5e50f16d98472bd</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Dec 2024 03:11:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>双城之战第二季看完了，我们很喜欢各种女角色，也喜欢各种酷炫的视觉效果。这一期我们会夸夸它的女性力量，吐槽它碎片化、没逻辑的故事剧情和对运动的简单想象，最后会对着动漫设定来聊一些国际关系和内战的理论。</span></p><p><span>你将听到的声音有：</span></p><p><span>🍄Emily</span></p><p><span>🍍菠萝油</span></p><p></p><p><span>本期提到的作者和书籍：</span></p><ul><li><span>种族、叛乱与内战 Fearon, James D., and David Laitin. "Ethnicity, Insurgency, and Civil War." </span><em><span>American Political Science Review</span></em><span> 97, no. 1 (2003): 75-82.</span></li><li><span>不满与内战 Fearon, James. "Grievances and Civil War." </span><em><span>Monkey Cage Blog</span></em><span>, April 2014.</span></li><li><span>当战斗爆发时——解释内战爆发的次国家层面差异 Koren, Ore. "When Fighting Breaks Out – Explaining Subnational Variation In Civil War Onset." </span><em><span>Political Violence at a Glance</span></em><span>, March 1, 2018.</span></li><li><span>安全困境与族群冲突 Posen, Barry. "The Security Dilemma and Ethnic Conflict." </span><em><span>Survival</span></em><span> 35, no. 1 (1993): 27-47.</span></li><li><span>谁会参战？内战参与的决定因素 Humphreys, M., and J. M. Weinstein. "Who Fights? The Determinants of Participation in Civil War." </span><em><span>American Journal of Political Science</span></em><span> 52, no. 2 (2008): 436-455.</span></li><li><span>政治暴力的"模式"应该意味着什么？手段、目标选择、频率和技术 Gutiérrez-Sanín, Francisco, and Elisabeth Jean Wood. "What Should We Mean by 'Pattern of Political Violence'? Repertoire, Targeting, Frequency, and Technique." </span><em><span>Perspectives on Politics</span></em><span> 15, no. 1 (2017): 20-41.</span></li></ul><p><span>也推荐大家听菠萝油介绍的“普通玩家”播客关于双城之战的节目❤️。</span></p>]]></description>
