  <item>
    <title>025如何看待爱丽丝·门罗的沉默和包庇？|野生芝士</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668f4b7d5035890798efa118</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668f4b7d5035890798efa118</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Jul 2024 02:46:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>——我们被✂️了——</span></p><p><span>小宇宙上需要梯子才能👂</span></p><p><span>也可以试一下分享到w·x</span></p><p><span>——谢谢大家还在❤️——</span></p><p></p><p><span>7月7日安德莉亚·罗宾·斯金纳自述曾被继父杰拉德·弗莱姆林性侵的新闻，她在文中着重讲述了她的母亲—诺贝尔文学奖获得者爱丽丝·门罗对她遭遇的忽视和对性侵者的包庇。</span></p><p></p><p><span>刚刚参加完门罗读书会的我们都深感震惊，无法相信能够对女性日常生活进行细微描写、在文字中投入对女性的共情和理解并引发读者巨大共鸣的爱丽丝·门罗，居然能对身边的性暴力熟视无睹。</span></p><p></p><p><span>各种复杂情绪夹杂在一起，7月8日晚上我们临时决定录一期播客聊聊自己的感受。因场地和设备原因，本期播客音效欠佳，请大家见谅。 </span></p><p></p><p><span>你将听到的声音有：</span></p><p><span>🧽米凉粉</span></p><p><span>🍯蛋黄酱</span></p><p><span>✳️粽子</span></p><p><span> 🍄Emily</span></p><p></p><p><span>剪辑&amp;节目笔记：</span></p><p><span>🥔狼牙土豆</span></p><p></p><p><span>节目内容：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 爱丽丝·门罗是谁？她在丈夫性侵女儿的案子里扮演着怎样的角色？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="211">03:31</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1352">22:32</a> 看到新闻是什么感受和反应？如何看待互联网上出现的观点。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1353">22:33</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">27:11</a> 回想门罗的作品，好像有了新的理解。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1632">27:12</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a> 如何理解大多数人的沉默？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2132">35:32</a> 门罗书写的“逃离”和她自己的“逃离”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2133">35:33</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2335">38:55</a> “洛丽塔”与恋童癖的开脱。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2336">38:56</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2569">42:49</a> 门罗只会写“妥协的女性”吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">42:50</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2899">48:19</a> 门罗事件与母职有关吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2899">48:19</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3176">52:56</a> 如何理解门罗的选择？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3177">52:57</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3478">57:58</a> 还会继续读门罗的作品吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3478">57:58</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3556">59:16</a> 推荐一些女性作家。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3556">59:16</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3722">62:02</a> 我们期待怎样的女性创作者？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3722">62:02</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3949">65:49</a> 从门罗事件中获得的思考或启发？</span></p><p></p><p><span>本期提到的作者和书籍：</span></p><p><span>爱丽丝·门罗：《逃离》《快乐影子之舞》</span></p><p><span>林奕含：《房思琪的初恋乐园》</span></p><p><span>齐邦媛：《巨流河》</span></p><p><span>奇玛曼达·恩戈兹·阿迪契：《紫木槿》</span></p><p><span>金草叶</span></p><p><span>安妮·埃尔诺</span></p><p><span>瓦内莎·斯普林格拉：《同意》</span></p><p><span>上野千鹤子：《为了活下去的思想》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/61c67cb18548ba3136092df1/lubK9ENBYvV_Yxl0lOVNq_SshnRD.mp3" length="63252053" type="audio/mpeg"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:05:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tZWRpYS5yc3MuY29tL3dpbGRjaGVlc2UvMjAyMTEyMjRfMTExMjA2XzcwYTI0M2E1Y2QwM2E5MWFlYjFhOWE3N2RkZDUxNjdhLmpwZw==.jpg"/>
