    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客接着聊苏联解体后俄罗斯寡头的兴起、克格勃、Putin的发家史、运动员兴奋剂丑闻等内容。</span></p><p><span>——我们被✂️了——</span></p><p><span>小宇宙上需要梯子才能👂</span></p><p><span>也可以试一下分享到w·x</span></p><p><span>——谢谢大家还在❤️——</span></p><p></p><p><span>你将听到的声音:</span></p><p><span>🧽米凉粉</span></p><p><span>🍯蛋黄酱</span></p><p><span>🍮丁丁</span></p><p><span>🍄Emily</span></p><p></p><p><span>剪辑&amp;节目笔记:</span></p><p><span>🥔狼牙土豆</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span>本期内容有:</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a>  寡头：我们很熟悉的大佬/大爹。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1191">19:51</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a>  苏联解体前后的经济震荡与机遇 。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1771">29:31</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a> 克格勃是个什么组织？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2369">39:29</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3160">52:40</a> 浅聊</span><em><span>Putin</span></em><span>的发家史和他的宫殿。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3161">52:41</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3489">58:09</a> 战斗民族的代表人物形象养成记。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3489">58:09</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3668">61:08</a> 兴奋剂丑闻。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3668">61:08</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4225">70:25</a> 辉煌史之下被牺牲的运动员。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4225">70:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4731">78:51</a> 俄罗斯人的伤与痛。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4740">79:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4900">81:40</a> 为什么关心俄罗斯？</span></p><p></p><p><span>本期提到的参考资料有</span><strong><span>:</span></strong></p><p><span>书籍：</span></p><p><span>《寡头-新俄罗斯的财富与权力》</span></p><p><span>《二手时间》</span></p><p><span>《谁在掌控俄罗斯》</span></p><p><span>《Other Russia》</span></p><p><span>影视:</span></p><p><span>《Putin’s palace》</span></p><p><span>《战斗民族养成记》</span></p><p><span>《禁药密档》</span></p><p><span>《伊卡洛斯》</span></p>]]></description>
