  <item>
    <title>024（上）隔壁的俄罗斯：从欧洲梦到民族自信|野生芝士</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666935787cedb8f7e201b173</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666935787cedb8f7e201b173</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Jun 2024 05:41:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>野生芝士邀请了三位朋友浅聊一下俄罗斯的“前世今生”。本集内容有俄罗斯古代史，俄罗斯贵族的欧洲梦，十二月党人革命和苏联时期。</span></strong></p><p></p><p><span>——我们被✂️了——</span></p><p><span>小宇宙上需要梯子才能👂</span></p><p><span>也可以试一下分享到w·x</span></p><p><span>——谢谢大家还在❤️——</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>你将听到的声音：</span></strong></p><p></p><p><span>🧽</span><strong><span>米凉粉</span></strong></p><p><span>🍯</span><strong><span>蛋黄酱</span></strong></p><p><span>🍮</span><strong><span>丁丁</span></strong></p><p><span>🍄</span><strong><span>Emily</span></strong></p><p></p><p><strong><span>剪辑&amp;节目笔记：</span></strong></p><p><span>🥔</span><strong><span>狼牙土豆</span></strong></p><p></p><p><strong><span>本期内容有:</span></strong></p><p></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="521">08:41</a> 不是专家的我们能带给听众什么？</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="533">08:53</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a>在准备这期播客之前对俄罗斯的印象是什么样的？</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="587">09:47</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="757">12:37</a> 学习资料大公开（详见下文参考目录）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a> 古罗斯，另一部《权力的游戏》？</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1042">17:22</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a> 俄罗斯的“欧洲热”</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1465">24:25</a> 贵族与农奴的爱情：圈养金丝雀？</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1468">24:28</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 从欧洲梦到重拾民族自信：先学俄语吧</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2041">34:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2331">38:51</a> 十二月党人革命，从封建时期迈入现代化进程。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2337">38:57</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> 开放与保守，隔代遗传？</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2463">41:03</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2763">46:03</a>俄罗斯文豪大塌房？</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3281">54:41</a> 苏联时期的历史，我们不陌生。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3287">54:47</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3660">61:00</a> 车臣与俄罗斯的历史纠葛今天仍在继续。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3660">61:00</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3799">63:19</a> 古拉格，苏联的奥斯维辛。</span></strong></p><p></p><p><strong><span>本期提到的参考资料有：</span></strong></p><p></p><p><strong><span>纪录片：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>《纳瓦尔尼》</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>《普京的宫殿》</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>《禁药密档》</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>《伊卡洛斯》</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>《马里乌波尔的20天》</span></strong></p><p></p><p><strong><span>书籍：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>《The Other Russia》</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>《娜塔莎之舞》</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>《谁在掌控俄罗斯》</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>《耳语者-斯大林时代苏联的私人生活》</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>《寡头-新俄罗斯的财富与权力》</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>《莫斯科绅士》</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>《1984》</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>《我们一无所有》</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>《古拉格群岛》</span></strong></p>]]></description>
