    <title>023（下）吃了些苦，但还是想当一个箭人|野生芝士</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66512ca7193c150243121954</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66512ca7193c150243121954</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 25 May 2024 00:00:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>——我们被✂️了——</span></p><p><span>小宇宙上需要梯子才能👂</span></p><p><span>也可以试一下分享到w·x</span></p><p><span>——谢谢大家还在❤️——</span></p><p></p><p><span>你将听到的声音：</span></p><p></p><p><span>🌻夏夏：早点下班主播、攻防箭活动组织者、射准爱好者</span></p><p><span>🍯豆瓣酱：野生射手</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>剪辑&amp;节目笔记：</span></strong></p><p><span>🥔</span><strong><span>狼牙土豆</span></strong></p><p></p><p><span>本期内容有：</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> </span></strong><span>参加射箭比赛是怎样的体验？浅聊一下比赛规则</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> </span></strong><span>射箭很“男”吗？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1126">18:46</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1295">21:35</a> </span></strong><span>为什么这么小众的运动，比赛却这么多？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">21:37</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> </span></strong><span>比赛不能穿牛仔裤？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1603">26:43</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2198">36:38</a> </span></strong><span>通过比赛见识了箭圈生态</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2667">44:27</a> </span></strong><span>聊聊权威和分数崇拜</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2665">44:25</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3077">51:17</a> </span></strong><span>国外和国内箭圈大不同？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3078">51:18</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3390">56:30</a> </span></strong><span>吃了些苦，但还是想当一个箭人</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3392">56:32</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3602">60:02</a> </span></strong><span>诚邀大家入坑</span></p><p></p><p><span>本期提到的书籍：《神箭手》</span></p>]]></description>
